So: **billing is whatever amount you POST**, not an automatic per-session or per-hour formula tied to `StudentClass`.

### Finance (`/home/admin/backend/app/Http/Controllers/FinanceController.php`)

`SessionDuration` appears in **`calcHours`**, which backs **teaching-hour / subject-units style weighting** (from learning-record times or, if missing, course duration in minutes → hours). It is **not** used to price invoices in this controller.

```374:395:/home/admin/backend/app/Http/Controllers/FinanceController.php
    /**
     * Calculate teaching hours from a learning record's times (or fallback to StudentClass duration).
     */
    private function calcHours(?string $startTime, ?string $endTime, $studentClass = null): float
    {
        if ($startTime && $endTime) {
            ...
        }
        if ($studentClass && !empty($studentClass->SessionDuration) && $studentClass->SessionDuration > 0) {
            return $studentClass->SessionDuration / 60.0;
        }
        return 2.0; // default fallback: 2h per session
    }
```

